[[34m2026-06-10 19:39:24[0m] use_lora=True, use_lora_before=False, use_lora_after=True, lora_rank=32. Before = LoRA on the encoder stem / early downsampling; after = bottleneck and later decoder. Both can be enabled for two complementary adaptation regions.
[[34m2026-06-10 19:39:24[0m] LoRA rank: all listed adapters in this stack typically share this rank. Larger rank increases adapter capacity and parameter count roughly linearly in rank; too high can overfit small datasets, too low can underfit cross-view cues.
